  "id": "environmental-stress",
  "term": "environmental stress",
  "definition": "Environmental stress is psychological strain that develops through ongoing exposure to everyday conditions in a person’s surroundings rather than only from major life events. In urban life, these repeated and hard-to-control exposures can build up over time and affect mental health.",
